        "text": "Yeah I'm familiar. I've even read Warren Teitelman\u2019s thesis where advice comes from. But I think at least in the implementation what I have is a bit different.\n\n\n`fib(5)`*\u2192 `add(fib(sub(5, 1)), fib(sub(5, 2)))`*\n\n \nI don't know any aspect that lets you get things like this. They instead are about function boundaries. (Pardon the bad formatting, on mobile)",
